 the past year&#x27;s trends. Of the 566 books that were targeted in 2019, here are the most challenged, along with the reasons cited for censoring the books.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"28dc25d4554ede11\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 30, 2020\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.oif.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6d296565439b1295\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTop 10 Most Challenged Books of 2024 | Banned Books\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6d296565439b1295\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ala.org/bbooks/frequentlychallengedbooks/top10\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f9256092baf35d00\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEvery year, the American Library Association compiles a list of the Top 10 Most Frequently Challenged Books based on reports from the field and media coverage.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f9256092baf35d00\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6e6c79909761bdfe\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2019 Teens’ Top Ten Nominees announced | ALA\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6e6c79909761bdfe\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ala.org/news/2019/04/2019-teens-top-ten-nominees-announced\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bf92724171c13c8b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe American Library Association (ALA) today released the highly anticipated Top 10 Most Challenged Books List.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bf92724171c13c8b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"60345625a7360f94\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYALSA announces 2019 Quick Picks for Reluctant Young Adults | ALA\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"60345625a7360f94\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ala