arch\\n---\\nIf number of challenges are a marker of the serious themes of a book, Sherman Alexie’s The Absolutely True Diary of a Part-Time Indian is worthy of close attention as one of the top ten most challenged books of all time. The novel features a teenager born with disabilities including encephalitis, who has grown up on a reservation in Spokane, Washington.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6d4cd87eca4736fc\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.oif.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8fd8f46ab562ba1c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2015 Top Ten Most Challenged Books - Intellectual Freedom Blog\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8fd8f46ab562ba1c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.oif.ala.org/2015-top-ten-challenged-books/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b9dedd76b6a3fa02\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nDuring National Library Week, the Office for Intellectual Freedom publishes the list of Top Ten Most Challenged Books. We collect information from two sources: newspapers and reports submitted by individuals. All challenges are compiled into a database. Reports of challenges culled from newspapers ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b9dedd76b6a3fa02\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 11, 2016\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.oif.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ba58e994949e193d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTwelve Terrific Challenged LGBTQIAP+ Titles for Kids and Teens - Intellectual Freedom Blog\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ba58e994949e193d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.oif.ala.org/twelve-terrific-challenged-lgbtqiap-titles-for-kids-and-teens/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"758a61c990067760\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>And Tango Makes Three</strong>, illustrated by Henry Cole, published by Simon &amp; Schuster, 978-0689878459. This gentle account of two male penguins who raise a chick (based on real zoo penguins) has made the Top Ten Most Challenged Books list 9 times.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"758a61c990067760\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"June 29, 2020\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.oif.ala.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ca029ce7dea7017f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTop Ten Banned Book: Absolutely True Diary of a Part Time Indian - Intellectual Freedom Blog\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ca029ce7dea7017f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.oif.ala.org/top-ten-banned-book-absolutely-true-diary-of-a-part-time-indian/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c06fb3b6819b2e1e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>The Absolutely True Diary of a Part-Time Indian</strong> was the most-challenged book in the United States from 2010 to 2019 and was named one of the top ten most challenged books in 2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2017, 2018, and 2020.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c06fb3b6819b2e1e\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"April 29, 2022\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.oif.ala.org\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "site:oif.ala.org \"Top Ten Most Challenged Books\" 2018 pdf", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 820, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a7b9373f6e377959\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nALA's Top Ten Most Challenged Books of 2020 - Intellectual Freedom Blog\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a7b9373f6e377959\">>>", "url": "https://www.oif.ala.org/alas-top-ten-most-challenged-books-of-2020/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4a6d2a6963c8128f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nJoin us at Friday’s coffee chat with the authors of the #6 Most Challenged Book Somet